    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκᾰν-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make sufficient, qualify</i>, <i><span class="en">
